1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
I wanted a straight river.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The way ahead will not yield.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
You simply took a turn.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
There is another direction.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Let the straight line rest.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Let my hand follow the river.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
An obstacle becomes a view.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
A bend can carry us far.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Distance has more than one shape.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
A softer heart makes room.
